WEBVTT

NOTE Tears of Steel, 4:50 to 6:50, re-timed for the two-minute cut. (CC) Blender Foundation, mango.blender.org, CC BY 3.0.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
...and, action!

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.000
Memory overwrite in progress!

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
You're a jerk, Thom!

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Ohp- Sorry! Sorry.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Look Celia.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
We have to follow our passions.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.000
You have your robotics...

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.000
...and I just want to be awesome in space.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Okay, they're coming. Two minutes left!

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Speed it up, Thom!

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Vivacissimo!

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Why don't you just admit that you're
freaked out by my robot hand?

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Listen Celia, I was young...

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.000
...and a dick.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.000
But that's no reason to
destroy the world.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Why does he do this?

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.500
We already tried that one!

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:22.500
Abort!

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Cut!

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Whoaaa!

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Whoaaa!

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.000
Nooooo!

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.000
You broke my heart.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.000
I know.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.000
You forgot me on earth.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.000
I know.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:43.000
I should just crush you.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.000
I'm-

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.000
I'm sorry.
